  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "ツノを　にぎる　わずかな　ちがいから\nトレーナーの　きもちを　よみとるので\nいったいとなって　はしれるのだ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "뿔을 잡을 때 느껴지는 작은 차이로\n트레이너의 마음을 읽어낼 수 있기에\n하나가 되어 달릴 수 있는 것이다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Quand son Dresseur le tient par une corne, il est\ncapable de deviner ses plus subtils changements\nd’humeur et de s’y adapter.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es kann die Stimmung seines Trainers an der kleinsten\nVeränderung dessen Griffes um seine Hörner ablesen\nund galoppiert sofort los, wenn dieser es wünscht.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Percibe los sentimientos del Entrenador por la forma\nen la que agarra sus cuernos, aunque sean variaciones\nsutiles, y así avanzan como si fueran un solo ente.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "È in grado di intuire gli stati d’animo del suo Allenatore\ndal modo in cui questi gli afferra le corna. Questo\npermette a entrambi di correre in perfetta armonia.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It can tell how its Trainer is feeling by\nsubtle shifts in the grip on its horns.\nThis empathic sense lets them run as if one being.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "ツノを　握る　わずかな　違いから\nトレーナーの　気持ちを　読み取るので\n一体となって　走れるのだ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Percibe los sentimientos del Entrenador por la forma\nen la que agarra sus cuernos, aunque sean variaciones\nsutiles, y así avanzan como si fueran un solo ente.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "さんがくちたいで　せいかつする。\nツノを　ぶつけあう　ちからくらべの\nしょうしゃが　むれの　リーダーだ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "산악 지대에서 생활한다.\n뿔을 서로 부딪쳐서 힘을 겨루어\n승자가 무리의 리더가 된다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Ce Pokémon vit dans les régions montagneuses.\nLe chef du troupeau s’impose à l’issue d’un combat\nde cornes.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Sie leben im Gebirge. Der Herdenanführer wird durch\nein Kräftemessen gewählt, bei dem die Anwärter ihre\nHörner gegeneinander rammen.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Habita en regiones montañosas. El líder de la manada\nse decide en una demostración de fuerza en la que los\ncontendientes luchan con los cuernos.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Vive in regioni montuose. Questi Pokémon\nstabiliscono il leader del gruppo confrontandosi\na cornate.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "They inhabit mountainous regions.\nThe leader of the herd is decided by\na battle of clashing horns.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
